<title>JAPAN: Namura to make friendly bid for Orii Corp.</title>
<headline>Namura to make friendly bid for Orii Corp.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Namura Shipbuilding Co Ltd said on Thursday that it would purchase a 33.71 percent stake in factory-automation equipment maker Orii Corp in a friendly takeover bid.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Namura said that the company would spend about 1.9 billion yen to buy 3.1 million shares in Orii from corporate and individual shareholders.</p>
<p>The stock purchase will be conducted during a 21-day period from July 18 to August 7, Namura said in a statement.</p>
</text>
